<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17110" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτλητος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτλᾱτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be
				borne, insufferable,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος, ἄχος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.367
			</span></i>, cf. Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				6.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγελία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					223
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be dared,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτλητα τλᾶσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					408
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>incapable of bearing, impatient of,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόθων ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.321
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antim.
			</span></i> ?). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, φέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
